@startuml subscription-state
title WF-06 | SubscriptionStatus
hide empty description
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

state " " as Creation <<choice>>
[*] --> Creation : create subscription
Creation --> PENDING : create [paid checkout] / snapshot purchased limits
Creation --> ACTIVE : create [eligible free plan or authorized Admin creation]\n/ set dates and zero usage
PENDING --> ACTIVE : apply [payment confirmed (BR-66)] / set dates and enable quotas
PENDING --> CANCELLED : apply [payment failed or checkout expired]
ACTIVE --> ACTIVE : cancelSubscription [expirationDate >= today]\n/ set cancelAtPeriodEnd
ACTIVE --> EXPIRED : expire [expirationDate < today and no cancellation scheduled]
ACTIVE --> CANCELLED : expire [expirationDate < today and cancellation scheduled]
ACTIVE --> CANCELLED : cancelSubscription [expirationDate < today]
ACTIVE --> CANCELLED : apply [a replacement subscription is activated]
ACTIVE --> CANCELLED : complete [refund confirmed]
EXPIRED --> CANCELLED : complete [refund confirmed after expiry]
CANCELLED --> [*]

note right of ACTIVE
  Quota use requires an unexpired subscription,
  available quota and no refund hold (BR-65).
end note
@enduml
